5. Add a ground symbol (`GND`), reference `PWR2`,
   positioned below the diode.  
6. Add a resistor (`R1`), reference `R1`,
   positioned right of the diode with rotation 0°.  
7. Wire the pins as described in the four steps above.  
8. Finish with `write_out_all_wires()` to output the schematic.

